From: QIU023 <yiqiaoqiu@hotmail.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 04:48:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] overrides: Kimi's attention residual fused with
 flash-linear-attention

fused_attnres swaps every AttentionResidual for fla's fused Triton op,
which saves per-token statistics instead of the FP32 stack and rebuilds
the upcasts in backward. fla is optional: without it, or off CUDA, the
aggregation falls back to the eager form. The op runs no collective, so
its autograd Function is registered as local for SPMD type checking.
